<div class="mandarin-hanzi">地图</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">dìtú</div>

''Meaning:'' map  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
请看地图上的路。 — Qǐng kàn dìtú shang de lù. — Please look at the road on the map.

!! Usage note
地图 (dìtú) can be printed or digital. For locations marked on a map, 在地图上 (zài dìtú shang) means 'on the map'; 上 (shang) is neutral in this locative expression.
